  "ruleText": "Lot 301.02 Scope. The requirements of this chapter shall apply to individuals or entities seeking to obtain or currently hold a lottery retailer license from the New Hampshire lottery commission.\n\nSource. #14474, eff 1-7-26, EXPIRES 1-7-36",
